  "2026-10-11T07:25:26.023Z",codex-sol-pm-ops,"Restored-main exact Git CI identity command env HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check exited 0. It ran 579 tests: 577 passed, 0 failed/canceled, 2 existing opt-in skips. Coverage remains 100/100/100/100 for 23 production source files; duplication zero of 23828 lines across 54 sources; 225 declarations documented; production audit zero vulnerabilities; complete packing, changelog/date, publish attestation, eight policies and governed item evidence checks passed. No global/system Git identity was used. Main package/lock files are restored with no diff. Final baseline bun run release:check and actual packed npm/native-Bun consumer validation remain pending.\n"
  "2026-10-11T07:40:46.798Z",codex-sol-pm-ops,"Final evidence: exact #153 head baf2f87902a8ad554f2258d417c3cab6d2c64f3c package/lock overlay (SDK 2026.10.10, pm-changelog 2026.10.5) passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check. Restored base 3fca1f2561719bdbf062160b652be1cbe907c51b metadata (SDK 2026.10.10, pm-changelog 2026.10.4) passed env HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check and final bun run release:check. EACH full gate: 579 tests, 577 passed, 0 failed/canceled, 2 existing opt-in skips; coverage 100/100/100/100 across 23 production sources; duplication 0/23828 lines across 54 sources; 225 documented declarations; production audit zero vulnerabilities; complete packing/changelog/date/publish/eight-policy/completeness checks passed. npm run accept:packed exited 0 for both npm/Node and native Bun: real create/validate/strict merge-driver health, actual extension SDK activation and nested auditors, npm 11 packing plus npm 10.9.4 ignore-scripts configuration byte identity; candidate tarball SHA256 7db108f49a626867130ab93fd3bcce0fd2393e7cc11a3348c156584d6af0a7c6. Final pm test ops-hiee --run --only-last --progress exited 0: focused command node --test test/dependency-contract.test.ts test/compatibility-floor.test.ts test/windows-proof-history.test.ts, 9 passed, 0 failed/canceled/skipped; ten inconsistent-metadata refusals remain active. Behavioral control restored only original development-pin/installed-pin callback functions from git show origin/main:test/compatibility-floor.test.ts with their original captured constant: 8 passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped; restored fixes pass 9/9. Changed behavior: developmentCliVersion; those two compatibility callbacks; packed consumer pin/expected-version generation; replaceFunction and native Windows function-only control loop; buildFixture/buildMergeReceiptLab and real-c8/installed-routing fixture lifetimes; parser test callbacks use unchanged 2000ms CPU budgets. All package/workflow overlays are restored. Historical #151 Bun remains 576 passed/1 genuine unaudited-settlement failure/2 skips; redundant historical npm runs were intentionally interrupted, never approval. #151 is already closed/explained by the orchestrator; current #153 remains open and needs rebase after this fix merges. Native Windows and Node 22/26 CI remain to be verified. Existing five high development audit findings and twelve pre-contract completeness backlog items remain separate from passing production audit/governed-item checks. Focused PM context worked; full gates ran directly, so no full-PM-wrapper approval or PM_PATH defect is claimed. Item stays in progress for orchestrator verification, never closed.\n"
